{"id": "66762", "title": "白莲花掘地大反攻", "author": "花悄然绽放", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 55, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66762.htm", "intro": "文案一\r\n 这是一个圈，一个小小的圈子把各种各样的人圈在一起。\r\n 还有这个圈子很乱\r\n 女主是朵白莲花，女配就是绿茶表。\r\n 男主很腹黑\r\n 此文很慢热，剧情保证流畅，求读者大大们包养\r\n 本坑很强大，掉下请自带氧气，作者不送氧气罩。\r\n 文案二\r\n 女配抱着恨跳楼自杀；\r\n 命运的轮回给她一次重新走过的机会；\r\n 女配是否像上辈子一般，那样弱懦；\r\n 而前女主是否能坚守自己的阵营，不让女配得逞；\r\n 花俏俏再一次挑战重生文，这次是现言的重生文，是否能撞出不一样的火花。\r\n 腹黑女的对战，命运之神是站在那一方？\r\n 郑重申明，女主的母亲不是小三，现在不说原因，后面会写到的。\r\n 此水井很深，掉错不许吭，脏话请自动蔽频。\r\n \r\n 推荐基友文的言情文↓\r\n 穿越：村姑‘戏’呆夫鼎炉男主，给我躺好！穿越女的宅斗生活[网王]我之于真田少年的悲哀\r\n \r\n \r\n 推荐基友文的耽美文↓\r\n 你不相伴，我也滚蛋这一定不是我写的文\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n #favorite_1{color:red;font-weight:bold;}", "base": "files/article/html/66/66762", "chapters": [{"title": "chapter ONE", "file": "10148227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 2", "file": "10148229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 3", "file": "10148230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 4", "file": "10148231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 5", "file": "10148232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 6", "file": "10148233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 7", "file": "10148234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 8", "file": "10148235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 9", "file": "10148237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 10", "file": "10148238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 11", "file": "10148239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 12", "file": "10148240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 13", "file": "10148241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 14", "file": "10148243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 15", "file": "10148244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 16", "file": "10148245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 17", "file": "10148246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 18", "file": "10148247.html", "ava